{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Public+logistics+access&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Public logistics access\",\"pageid\":244,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><table class=\\\"wikitable\\\" style=\\\"float:right\\\">\\n\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th colspan=\\\"2\\\">Information\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>Effect</td>\\n<td>All <a href=\\\"/index.php/Corporation\\\" title=\\\"Corporation\\\">corporations</a> can <a href=\\\"/index.php/Export\\\" title=\\\"Export\\\">export</a> and buy <a href=\\\"/index.php/Category:Asset\\\" title=\\\"Category:Asset\\\">assets</a> as if they had an additional <a href=\\\"/index.php/Logistics_center\\\" title=\\\"Logistics center\\\">logistics center</a><br /> in this <a href=\\\"/index.php/Region\\\" title=\\\"Region\\\">region</a> (this does not affect <a href=\\\"/index.php/Market#Market_access\\\" title=\\\"Market\\\">market access</a>), +10% to all <a href=\\\"/index.php/Category:Facility\\\" title=\\\"Category:Facility\\\">facilities</a>' build price\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td>Cost</td>\\n<td>1 <a href=\\\"/index.php/Funding_point\\\" title=\\\"Funding point\\\">Funding point</a>\\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\\n<p>A <a href=\\\"/index.php/Category:Policy\\\" title=\\\"Category:Policy\\\">policy</a> that allows all <a href=\\\"/index.php/Corporation\\\" title=\\\"Corporation\\\">corporations</a> to <a href=\\\"/index.php/Export\\\" title=\\\"Export\\\">export</a> and buy as if they had an additional <a href=\\\"/index.php/Logistics_center\\\" title=\\\"Logistics center\\\">logistics center</a>. Does not allow <a href=\\\"/index.php/Market#Market_access\\\" title=\\\"Market\\\">market access</a> if no <a href=\\\"/index.php/Logistics_center\\\" title=\\\"Logistics center\\\">logistics center</a> has been built in that region.\\n</p>\\n<!